Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon.\NOut on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They are developing extremely quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All four of these children\Nhave incredible skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't get one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My little masterpieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They have us make such lavish food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did they take it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't had any guests lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so nosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is to cook the food,\Nnot to ask questions about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you royalty\Ndoesn't serve anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead, and you know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop trying to be like your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened are you all right there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sanji, huh? His majesty ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,us not to allow you into the kitchen\Noh please I beg you let me stay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To see my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But the weather is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the medical ward is so\Nfar! I'm fine! But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell my dad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take shelter now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't make this food for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master Sanji, you came here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This was very thoughtful of you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I worry a meal like this\Nwill upset Her Majesty's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, maybe it doesn't\Ntaste as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, it's pouring, and\Nyou still came to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father will be so\Nfurious if he finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, did you make this food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ebony?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please bring me the food\NSanji really made at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I would,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but you see, it got ruined on the way\Nover here and there was no salvaging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So I threw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it in right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's omelet rolls with\Nsome fish and a banana, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I messed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was running and I tripped in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It got smooshed and it's\Nall soggy, too. Let's try
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you cook for me some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you cook for me some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to bring\Nyou stuff to cook with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The all-blue, a place with\Nfish from all four seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,legendary waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that, told you, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that is Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would Dad lie\Nabout something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he wishes he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if Sanji really did die, I wonder if\NDad would be happy when he heard the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been a failure, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'm on your side\Njust because I patched you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not involved, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three don't get sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They never feel sympathy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Father thinks they're such great fighters\Nbecause they don't have emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My body has some physical modifications,\Ntoo, but I actually have emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, thanks for helping me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think we're supposed to\Ncross over the red line soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to fight in some wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wars?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to\Ndepart for the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The estimated travel time is three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a cook, no\Nmatter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeremiah Double Six is here! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems Koshia's soldiers noticed\Nus before we were able to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then subdue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to tell me stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just run away somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,while we're in the East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll be free, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can live the rest of my life\Nwithout ever seeing Dad's face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Back away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You only get one chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So try not to mess it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father's hiding the key to\Nyour mask in his bedroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so you need to go in\Nthere and get it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check outside to see if\Nit's safe enough for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get to father's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,look for a symbol on the\Nwall that looks like a skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you'll find the secret door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave this wretched kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one's getting in\Nmy way, not even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've developed quite an attitude\Nsince you've been locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're normal, and that makes you weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a sea in this entire world\Nwhere you can survive on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what you still can't\Nstop me. I wouldn't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to it feels strange to\Nadmit this but I suppose I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,am human after all even\Nthough my son is useless
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to\Nkill him but you're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll go away voluntarily
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and i'll gladly let you\Nhave the key to that iron
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,mask listen sanji before
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you and i part ways for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the last time there is\Nsomething i must ask of you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,if anyone ever asks about your family, you\Nmust never tell them who your father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Having you as a son is my greatest shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the cruise ship at the port?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were just unlucky to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to board that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying like a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never come back here, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You will meet nice\Npeople out there someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Dash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yum, these are good! Good! Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That son of a bird is eating the biscuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you even think\Nto do that, you freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because biscuits are food and I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best way to get rid\Nof food is to eat it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So dig in and don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This Fraulein is tremendously crafty, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they knock him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Race, we were just\Ngoing to give him treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, get out of my way! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to meet your\Nfiancé with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All you had to do was\Ngive up on that old chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you wouldn't have\Nto suffer like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you wanted to\Nforget this place. Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might actually be full now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've been at this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.14,0:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You eat, you run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You come back and eat some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Straw Hat guy even human?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cracker may be scary, but that\Nguy's appetite is the real terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My General Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So with his power, he really can\Nkeep making biscuits forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll run out of energy soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:22:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:23:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and keep eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll give up on your friend\Nwhen you're doubled over in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm never gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat and eat, and then\NI'll go rescue Soji. That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring out more biscuit\Nwarriors for you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep eating till you pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.12,0:23:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, King Baum,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama is going to be very disappointed when\NI tell her about your untimely betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shearing off mine branches\Nwasn't cool enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair, my general.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This Fraulein has Mama's Weaver card.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's using our power to\Nmake us bow down to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So technically it's Mama's\Npower we are obeying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your excuses for her then. Cause\NI'll never forgive you bastards for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This would be over if you\Nhadn't helped that insufferable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,woman My biscuit warriors\Nare supposed to be invincible
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.78,0:24:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And now look at them reduced\Nto yummy crunchy snacks all
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to you Stop your whining\NThis is a pirate battle, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.62,0:24:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I figured out your weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.80,0:24:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you get to take\Nit out on my underlings, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.44,0:24:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Ha-ha! Underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.44,0:24:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really what we've been reduced to?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.98,0:24:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am! Sorry! Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.14,0:24:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Biscuit warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.98,0:24:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They come right back\Nwhen I break them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, eating's all that's worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.32,0:24:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.96,0:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really hungry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to protect me, homies, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.78,0:24:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.26,0:24:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we try something\Nother than eating them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way to\Nstop them from reforming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.70,0:24:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather egg, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.92,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boss may be an emperor, but\NI don't know you and I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy won't lose, because he's\Ngoing to be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, there's\Nno limit to his appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been eating all night long. Still, he\Nhungers, his stomach's like a black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do it, Tanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.40,0:25:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.92,0:26:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready. All preparations are\Ncomplete here as well, good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform my children—we're\Ndeparting for the whole cake Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.32,0:26:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready this'll hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.54,0:26:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put it on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.98,0:26:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Barely tingles,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,swelling
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,has
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,gone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.03,0:26:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Swelling is the only thing the mask fixes;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.68,0:26:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it suppresses the body's\Nnatural response to
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:27:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,an injury but it actually\Nslows your recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.46,0:27:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.42,0:27:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,better than showing a face\Nlike that to your Fancy though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The charlotte family never\Ntakes their spouse's last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be a vinsmoke anymore if you get
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,along well enough—you\Nmight live a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.76,0:27:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Nexpecting from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,your own
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.06,0:27:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that chivalry come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Women! Women! Women! Women! Women!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.14,0:27:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not hiring any ladies here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I punctuate my lessons\Nwith a swift kick to the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.86,0:28:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't very well treat a woman that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.86,0:28:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can kick me, then\Nyou can kick a girl, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You little fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.66,0:28:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A man must never kick a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.12,0:28:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been the golden rule\Nsince the age of the dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.16,0:28:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As a human, you're gonna make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.58,0:28:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.58,0:28:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But as a man, if you ever\Nstray from the honorable path,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll chop off your\Nballs as punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.38,0:28:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and slit my own throat\Nwhile I'm at it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you slit your own throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.16,0:28:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as a parent, I gotta\Ntake responsibility too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't become the kind of person I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.40,0:28:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get back to work, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Golden Rule from the Age of Dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.68,0:29:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,May I enter, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, sir, it's time to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.82,0:29:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an engagement ceremony\Nto attend at the Whole Cake Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.48,0:29:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you'd better put on a clean shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.00,0:29:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a member of the\Nroyal family after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to present yourself like\Na Vinsmoke or we'll look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.30,0:29:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I give a crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in Brule's mirror world...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.74,0:29:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.60,0:30:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.14,0:30:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.82,0:30:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can run anymore, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.92,0:30:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you trip and break a mirror,\Nyour luck's gonna get even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a wonderful wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.72,0:30:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sanji, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.78,0:30:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.69,0:30:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.90,0:30:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And so begins a new era\Nfor the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave to the citizens now, Sanji. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.44,0:31:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.16,0:31:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.10,0:31:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.62,0:31:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No more biscuits, everybody go home, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.42,0:31:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're finally full. I'm full,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.04,0:32:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm holding all those biscuits I ate\Nin my stomach if it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.00,0:32:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to throw up to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just pop you right open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.58,0:32:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Joke's on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.48,0:32:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.64,0:33:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this form Tank\NMan Stuffed Vergeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.46,0:33:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, he's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got a kind of different\Nfeel than your last transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.86,0:33:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but can you even move because\Nyou look pretty bloated to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.02,0:33:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cracker's blade can't cut out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.58,0:33:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this guy made out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.98,0:33:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you,\Nyou stubborn little pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.42,0:33:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've pushed me over the edge, Stryhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.58,0:33:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't cut you, then\NI'll stab you instead! Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.16,0:34:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Brunzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.74,0:34:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll burst you open this\Ntime, mark my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.40,0:34:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Crash pretzel!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.66,0:34:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His skin is hard, but it's soft, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.14,0:34:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pull away!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.02,0:34:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Biscuit warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.76,0:34:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.56,0:34:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.47,0:35:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the biscuits wet!
