Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I need them to stay hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.04,0:35:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.74,0:35:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you the power\Nof me on a full stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.82,0:35:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.14,0:35:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you to the far\Nends of the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.90,0:35:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog-gog cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No more biscuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.06,0:36:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
